@host = http://localhost:5120

### Search recipes by name
GET {{host}}/api/recipes?search=soup

### Search by ingredient, sorted by prep time, page 1
GET {{host}}/api/recipes?ingredient=chicken&sortBy=prepTime&sortDir=asc&page=1&pageSize=5

### Recipe details
GET {{host}}/api/recipes/2

### Not found -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/recipes/9999

### Create recipe -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/recipes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Potato soup",
  "description": "Simple and warm soup.",
  "servings": 4,
  "prepTimeMinutes": 40,
  "categoryId": 2,
  "ingredients": [
    { "name": "Potato", "quantity": 500, "unit": "g" },
    { "name": "Onion", "quantity": 1, "unit": "pcs" }
  ],
  "steps": [
    { "instruction": "Peel and dice the potatoes." },
    { "instruction": "Boil for 20 minutes, blend." }
  ]
}

### Invalid body -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/recipes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "x", "categoryId": 2, "ingredients": [], "steps": [] }

### Delete -> 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/recipes/5

### Categories and ingredients
GET {{host}}/api/categories

###
GET {{host}}/api/ingredients?search=po
